{"screen_name": "ichiru_ruchi", "file": "ichiru_ruchi", "name": "ichiru🎇illustrator", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1716063311907975168/DkgAJlDN.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1716063071570194432/1698036168/1500x500", "description": "illustration creation｜character design\n日本語,EN OK\nCommission open\nVgen：https://vgen.co/ichiru\nskeb：https://skeb.jp/@ichiru_ruchi", "total_works": 31, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T12:06:05.670594+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T12:06:05.670594+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 10000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T12:06:05.670594+00:00"}], "comic": [{"amount": 15000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T12:06:05.670594+00:00"}], "video": [{"amount": 12000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T12:06:05.670594+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 10000, "comic": 15000, "video": 12000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 10000, "max": 10000}, "comic": {"min": 15000, "max": 15000}, "video": {"min": 12000, "max": 12000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/ichiru_ruchi", "name": "ichiru_ruchi"}, {"label": "Misskey_io", "url": "https://misskey.io/@ichiru_ruchi", "name": "ichiru_ruchi"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://vgen.co/ichiru", "name": ""}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/79438269", "name": "79438269"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@ichiru_ruchi/works/31", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2ae71628/uploads/origins/8b2d66ec-43b0-4ad9-ba54-cd262cad9250?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fbb84f5bf51d0d1a512ea8bc1ccbb139", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2ae71628/uploads/origins/8b2d66ec-43b0-4ad9-ba54-cd262cad9250?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fbb84f5bf51d0d1a512ea8bc1ccbb139, https://si.imgix.net/2ae71628/uploads/origins/8b2d66ec-43b0-4ad9-ba54-cd262cad9250?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=46a87806b18ba6bc5aeccc75838e55eb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2ae71628/uploads/origins/8b2d66ec-43b0-4ad9-ba54-cd262cad9250?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1b562b140a9fe20c22173d861e467db4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Ichiru! I hope you’ve been doing well. It’s been a while since I last requested a commission from you. The piece you made back then, the one with her holding the purple rose, is still my absolute favourite! I’m planning to take a break from Skeb after this request, but I’d love to ask for one more special piece from you.\n\nFor this piece, I’d love it to capture a serene, free, and uplifting mood, something that feels like a quiet, beautiful moment of freedom.\n\nI’d like you to draw the same pink-haired character in her usual gothic-style outfit with her hat. I’m imagining her sitting on a cathedral rooftop at sunset, with one hand resting beside her for support and the other reaching forward as if feeling the wind. The breeze should make her hair, hat ribbon, and skirt edges flow naturally. Her expression can be calm and happy, with a gentle smile as she enjoys the moment.\n\nThe details below are just suggestions, so please feel free to change or leave out anything as you see fit. Perhaps show her from mid-thigh up (similar to the previous commission), from a slight low angle. Let the sunset light softly illuminate her face and outfit details, with some shadows under the hat brim for depth. It would be nice to include ornate stonework or spires behind her, and maybe some petals or feathers drifting in the wind for atmosphere.\n\nI fully trust your artistic sense for composition and lighting,  please feel free to adjust any details as you see fit to match your style.  \n\nI am happy to adjust the amount if needed. Thank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1SCmYTcXPKLwt0L4lVD6PB_kUcx0YrrUG?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ichiru_ruchi/works/30", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/88380807/uploads/origins/fadf765f-52be-470f-ba28-885d5e244f95?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0e26291d3de4d1c3806a617b083f77eb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/88380807/uploads/origins/fadf765f-52be-470f-ba28-885d5e244f95?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0e26291d3de4d1c3806a617b083f77eb, https://si.imgix.net/88380807/uploads/origins/fadf765f-52be-470f-ba28-885d5e244f95?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=395bcb31e015d359a5a2dd37660b1ca8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/88380807/uploads/origins/fadf765f-52be-470f-ba28-885d5e244f95?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3203aab28d50544489685b22f4f58540 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "再びこんにちは！またVTuberのアートをお願いしたいです :)\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1nqHxLByzIzErdgwz-o8CH2sYNwLg7d7q/view?usp=drive_link\n\nポーズをとって枕で体を覆っているところをこのように描いていただけませんか？\nhttps://i.pinimg.com/1200x/a5/25/50/a52550b799784ebe782066ce391e79e0.jpg\n\n遊び心でウインクして舌を出して生意気な顔をしている彼女をお願いします。\n背景は寝室で床に座って鏡写真を撮っている彼女でもいいですか？こんな感じでいいですか？\nhttps://skeb.jp/@hanamasa_ono/works/133\n\n部屋のデザインはお好きなもので結構です。\nお忙しい中、ありがとうございました！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ichiru_ruchi/works/29", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/583fcae1/uploads/origins/dd93dac4-68d2-449e-b152-60f73cad2add?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52fa99fade6567913abe6b10b758216f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/583fcae1/uploads/origins/dd93dac4-68d2-449e-b152-60f73cad2add?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52fa99fade6567913abe6b10b758216f, https://si.imgix.net/583fcae1/uploads/origins/dd93dac4-68d2-449e-b152-60f73cad2add?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56db78ba0df553f3d16a589825db37e4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/583fcae1/uploads/origins/dd93dac4-68d2-449e-b152-60f73cad2add?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c84f0dd780d0499cf7f23bdd1f4d4c9a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "再びこんにちは！またまた、またまたお久しぶりです。以前描いていただいたVtuberとその友人の絵がとても気に入ったので、また描いていただけないでしょうか？\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1GbDrE2mrWwOI-LJNI1pfYuVMRw5rQTf_/view?usp=sharing\n今回はこのキャラクターでこの服装で描いていただけませんか？\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/GjmllTtbAAA_Hc3?format=jpg&name=4096x4096\nもし必要なら、彼女のツイッターをどうぞ。\nhttps://x.com/AkamiHebiko\n\nポーズや背景はほとんどお任せします！ただ、2人が一緒に笑っていて、楽しそうにしていてほしいです。\n本当にありがとうございました！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ichiru_ruchi/works/28", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b5edb623/uploads/origins/f94f94f9-f711-4543-a5b1-67b941958c85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e9c29865e73c669437736c01a8ac30f4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b5edb623/uploads/origins/f94f94f9-f711-4543-a5b1-67b941958c85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e9c29865e73c669437736c01a8ac30f4, https://si.imgix.net/b5edb623/uploads/origins/f94f94f9-f711-4543-a5b1-67b941958c85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9779c86497425f23ca7125664ecad75e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b5edb623/uploads/origins/f94f94f9-f711-4543-a5b1-67b941958c85?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8fa27ddaff7e30be5e51fc350db68d41 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの絵が本当に大好きです！\n私のVTuberとその友達を描いてくれませんか？\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/12XrHchgYlTOieQQvh0k1_eFCGOBrpnm6/view\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/Gjx1e4obAAAcvS9?format=jpg&name=large\n\nもっと参考にしたいのなら、彼女のツイッターもどうぞ。\nhttps://x.com/Goblinfia\n\nハグして笑っている二人を描いていただけませんか？\n背景は何でも構いません！\nよろしくお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ichiru_ruchi/works/27", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/746187ab/uploads/origins/7585d9b3-1b94-4c6f-85e4-e0c875d462e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d1887a89ad62106730bb73cb18fcc375", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/746187ab/uploads/origins/7585d9b3-1b94-4c6f-85e4-e0c875d462e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d1887a89ad62106730bb73cb18fcc375, https://si.imgix.net/746187ab/uploads/origins/7585d9b3-1b94-4c6f-85e4-e0c875d462e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=68cb1e17fc64bdc880aadff1a12b7efd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/746187ab/uploads/origins/7585d9b3-1b94-4c6f-85e4-e0c875d462e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1831143d86cdb0bdcc54322475c8a7d3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！自己紹介ありがとうございます。\n vtuber天櫻咲樂のバースデーアートを依頼したいです。\n彼女の布のデザインを変更することもできますし、セクシーにすることもできます。\n彼女の表情、姿勢、背景など、他のすべての詳細は完全にあなた次第です。\nこのアートワークは、彼女のストリームとカバーに使用することができます。\nご協力ありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/10Pl9XtUsw14PPNhnqE5xj_rNwm7ahIZm/view?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ichiru_ruchi/works/26", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3ec32268/uploads/origins/8fea38b7-43b4-44a4-924e-25d91f5e0b4a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=488615388b8686d367668988ac2735bb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3ec32268/uploads/origins/8fea38b7-43b4-44a4-924e-25d91f5e0b4a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=488615388b8686d367668988ac2735bb, https://si.imgix.net/3ec32268/uploads/origins/8fea38b7-43b4-44a4-924e-25d91f5e0b4a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9171ff0c4c9d99ca8c34818797613451 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3ec32268/uploads/origins/8fea38b7-43b4-44a4-924e-25d91f5e0b4a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c40c13c0622b874e411a665b3a66030c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi Ichiru, hope you are doing well! I would like to request another commission from you.\n\nI have this request in mind for a while and am hoping you can make it come true. Been thinking of seeing an illustration of my PSO2 characters. There are 3 characters that I want you to draw and I want something like a family photo. \n\n1) Chexina would be the same as usual, sharp chin and elf-like ears. Usually in a black and pink outfit. She would be the oldest caring sister and the tallest one out of the three, just slightly taller than Cilira. \n\n2) Cilira has a tomboy and sassy personality. Her outfit colour scheme is usually black and green. She has different iris colours. The main hair colour is black and the sub-colour is mint green. \n\n2)Sengami is cute and clumsy. She is the shortest of all three, she is usually dressed in a Japanese-themed outfit. The hair colour is mainly blue. \n\nThe references are mainly there for you to get a feel of how they look. You don't have to use any of the outfits and hairstyles. You can adjust or mix and match them. I will let you decide on the hairstyle, outfit, expression and colours for all three characters.\n\nYou don't have to worry too much about the background, if possible can you please focus more on the characters? As for pose, I would like them to have some body contact with each other. \n\nI understand this request included multiple characters, if the amount is not enough or if there are any issues please appeal to me. Thank you for your time and consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1WxDB1G0rc6w5cz0lUWJglBcqFTY9G-VI?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ichiru_ruchi/works/25", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d29d5c76/uploads/origins/a5b55c19-033b-4321-bf6a-05752dbcfcf2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=38201d5c8f3842e27e4588afed8ed6e7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d29d5c76/uploads/origins/a5b55c19-033b-4321-bf6a-05752dbcfcf2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=38201d5c8f3842e27e4588afed8ed6e7, https://si.imgix.net/d29d5c76/uploads/origins/a5b55c19-033b-4321-bf6a-05752dbcfcf2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0ad134df2d126a4eb98adadbec6a033f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d29d5c76/uploads/origins/a5b55c19-033b-4321-bf6a-05752dbcfcf2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=acf99597a0600d042e21861d9d692134 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi Ichiru, I hope you are doing well.\n\nI love the commission you have done for me, it was very detailed and charming.  I wonder if you would be willing to do another illustration for the same character?\n\nCan you please illustrate her turn around looking at you/audience while one hand is fixing her hair? It doesn't have to be full-body, I would suggest thigh-up. You can decide everything else for her. Please feel free to appeal if the amount is not enough or if you have any suggestions.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1SCmYTcXPKLwt0L4lVD6PB_kUcx0YrrUG?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ichiru_ruchi/works/24", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/db92d52d/uploads/origins/98c59586-7af4-4b84-a09e-5cbb13f06eb7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fc2eea81be0741b928bfab0975175c90", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/db92d52d/uploads/origins/98c59586-7af4-4b84-a09e-5cbb13f06eb7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fc2eea81be0741b928bfab0975175c90, https://si.imgix.net/db92d52d/uploads/origins/98c59586-7af4-4b84-a09e-5cbb13f06eb7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=df133bbda6c1c831a67f569291e9d1ea 2x, https://si.imgix.net/db92d52d/uploads/origins/98c59586-7af4-4b84-a09e-5cbb13f06eb7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f30799a31bb55827fa21c37f00e39e5f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "アピールをありがとう。  ぜひヴェリンを描いてほしい！  彼は現代を舞台に錬金術研究所を営むエルフです。  友だちとおしゃべりすること、本を読むこと、ジョークを言うこと、謎を解くこと、そして紅茶を飲むことが大好き。\n\n好きなように描いてください！  彼の服装や髪型は何種類かあります。  ソーシャルメディアや、場合によってはTwitchストリームで画像を使いたいと思います。\n\nありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/18Qditc-s7w1YDNTY8lNtYP4Ky0JX-Vrj", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ichiru_ruchi/works/23", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7d9570ee/uploads/origins/38c0db8d-6f62-4d23-acc8-1cea6df4229e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7f59886eade5ec3406f5afc70a589b91", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7d9570ee/uploads/origins/38c0db8d-6f62-4d23-acc8-1cea6df4229e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7f59886eade5ec3406f5afc70a589b91, https://si.imgix.net/7d9570ee/uploads/origins/38c0db8d-6f62-4d23-acc8-1cea6df4229e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c1675be9f76c60c01ee69e0052f27f58 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7d9570ee/uploads/origins/38c0db8d-6f62-4d23-acc8-1cea6df4229e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=00d40859e07062b2ec22d653dc569cd4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、あなたの絵がとても好きです。）\n\nモデルはビーチでビキニを着ていて、楽しい時間を過ごしている人がいいな！\n\nありがとうございます。）\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/j0CnI6S", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ichiru_ruchi/works/22", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d82cd991/uploads/origins/5d2fe02c-0ddf-467a-9607-6bf76f47a516?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9144c58fcb0f4361c0715e15d6200aba", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d82cd991/uploads/origins/5d2fe02c-0ddf-467a-9607-6bf76f47a516?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtcl